comments.body:
@pcbeingused333 Thanks for this. We can't merge it as is:

- Since v1.1.0, the server accepts an unset ZO_EXT_AUTH_SALT: it generates a salt and stores it in the DB. The failure in #252 was in v1.1.0-rc2.
- With Argo CD or helm template, lookup returns nothing, so every render creates a new salt. That restarts all pods and breaks ext-token logins.
